{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "BioSynth: Rising",
    "steam_appid": 3605500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BioSynth: Rising is a classic RPG set in a gripping sci-fi and cyberpunk world where technology and bio-engineering have blurred the lines of humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Rich World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a detailed and atmospheric setting, uncovering its secrets, navigating bustling cityscapes, and venturing into dangerous, uncharted territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/5c112028d2fc5fcd6221516359df2dab.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/5c112028d2fc5fcd6221516359df2dab.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/5c112028d2fc5fcd6221516359df2dab.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world with an isometric view.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Your Party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a diverse cast of companions, each with their own unique backstories, skills, and motivations. Forge bonds and build a party that complements your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/f2eb933398916c4ed06494e4c8b07d41.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/f2eb933398916c4ed06494e4c8b07d41.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/f2eb933398916c4ed06494e4c8b07d41.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventures, you'll meet characters that can be your companions. You can gather a party of up to 4 characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your characters through a class system and deep skill trees. Experiment with different combinations to create powerful builds and adapt to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/2f43750786a7105cf075f6385ceaf50e.avif?t=1755587651\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently there are 3 classes in the game (a fourth one is coming soon). Each class has access to 3 skill trees. Each skill tree has 8 active skills that you can cast when playing. It means that there's a total of 24 active skills per class, and you can even pick skills from different trees for max customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Powerful Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide array of weapons, armors, and augmentations. Equip your party with the best gear to overcome the dangers that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/0eb46a03a3f10e1a56e5d16ed503adc6.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=228 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/0eb46a03a3f10e1a56e5d16ed503adc6.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/0eb46a03a3f10e1a56e5d16ed503adc6.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the weapons will even grant special castable skills to your character. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strategic thinking in engaging turn-based battles. Utilize your party's skills and abilities to outmaneuver and defeat fearsome enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/851164c331bcb93cb6b4c5fed7d36ae7.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/851164c331bcb93cb6b4c5fed7d36ae7.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/851164c331bcb93cb6b4c5fed7d36ae7.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your turn, you'll be able to perform a number of actions, including moving, attacking, casting skills and using items, depending on the number of action points that your character possesses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unveil a Rich Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a compelling narrative set within a lore-rich world. Uncover the mysteries of BioSynth and the forces shaping its destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/d62ad1f900c5d52e3be6acf44ccc0856.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/d62ad1f900c5d52e3be6acf44ccc0856.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/d62ad1f900c5d52e3be6acf44ccc0856.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branched dialogs and quests will make you enjoy lots of fascinating stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic story where your decisions have real consequences, shaping the world around you and influencing the fates of your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/c62e1df2f4c95b01c897f5e664af6d41.avif?t=1755587651\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to a reputation system and a careful event management, NPC will respond in different ways to you and the world will change, depending on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BioSynth: Rising offers a nostalgic yet fresh take on the classic RPG formula, blending a captivating story with deep character customization and strategic turn-based combat in a unique sci-fi and cyberpunk setting. Prepare to make choices that will define your journey and the future of BioSynth.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BioSynth: Rising is a classic RPG set in a gripping sci-fi and cyberpunk world where technology and bio-engineering have blurred the lines of humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Rich World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a detailed and atmospheric setting, uncovering its secrets, navigating bustling cityscapes, and venturing into dangerous, uncharted territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/5c112028d2fc5fcd6221516359df2dab.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/5c112028d2fc5fcd6221516359df2dab.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/5c112028d2fc5fcd6221516359df2dab.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world with an isometric view.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Your Party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a diverse cast of companions, each with their own unique backstories, skills, and motivations. Forge bonds and build a party that complements your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/f2eb933398916c4ed06494e4c8b07d41.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/f2eb933398916c4ed06494e4c8b07d41.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/f2eb933398916c4ed06494e4c8b07d41.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventures, you'll meet characters that can be your companions. You can gather a party of up to 4 characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your characters through a class system and deep skill trees. Experiment with different combinations to create powerful builds and adapt to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/2f43750786a7105cf075f6385ceaf50e.avif?t=1755587651\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently there are 3 classes in the game (a fourth one is coming soon). Each class has access to 3 skill trees. Each skill tree has 8 active skills that you can cast when playing. It means that there's a total of 24 active skills per class, and you can even pick skills from different trees for max customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Powerful Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide array of weapons, armors, and augmentations. Equip your party with the best gear to overcome the dangers that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/0eb46a03a3f10e1a56e5d16ed503adc6.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=228 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/0eb46a03a3f10e1a56e5d16ed503adc6.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/0eb46a03a3f10e1a56e5d16ed503adc6.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the weapons will even grant special castable skills to your character. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strategic thinking in engaging turn-based battles. Utilize your party's skills and abilities to outmaneuver and defeat fearsome enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/851164c331bcb93cb6b4c5fed7d36ae7.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/851164c331bcb93cb6b4c5fed7d36ae7.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/851164c331bcb93cb6b4c5fed7d36ae7.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your turn, you'll be able to perform a number of actions, including moving, attacking, casting skills and using items, depending on the number of action points that your character possesses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unveil a Rich Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a compelling narrative set within a lore-rich world. Uncover the mysteries of BioSynth and the forces shaping its destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/d62ad1f900c5d52e3be6acf44ccc0856.poster.avif?t=1755587651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/d62ad1f900c5d52e3be6acf44ccc0856.webm?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/d62ad1f900c5d52e3be6acf44ccc0856.mp4?t=1755587651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branched dialogs and quests will make you enjoy lots of fascinating stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic story where your decisions have real consequences, shaping the world around you and influencing the fates of your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605500/extras/c62e1df2f4c95b01c897f5e664af6d41.avif?t=1755587651\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to a reputation system and a careful event management, NPC will respond in different ways to you and the world will change, depending on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BioSynth: Rising offers a nostalgic yet fresh take on the classic RPG formula, blending a captivating story with deep character customization and strategic turn-based combat in a unique sci-fi and cyberpunk setting. Prepare to make choices that will define your journey and the future of BioSynth.</p>",
